  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given differential equation is&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />I.F. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So the solution of the equation is&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math><br />Since <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi></math> we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
}